---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../site";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="David Fannar Gunnarsson’s side projects, experiments, and technical notes. Depill.is is operated by Supergut ehf, kennitala 430524-2160."
>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <div>
      <header class="page-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">Supergut ehf</span>
        <h1>
          About depill<span class="accent">.</span>
        </h1>
        <p>
          A personal notebook for side projects, experiments, and things worth
          sharing.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          I’m David Fannar Gunnarsson. I work for Globus Group and am based in
          Iceland. Supergut ehf is where I work on my side missions.
        </p>
        <h2>What I’m exploring</h2>
        <p>
          Depill is a space for my own side projects and interests: AI
          development, intelligent automation, Business Central, and process
          mapping. It’s where I can write things down as I explore them.
        </p>
        <p>
          I’m interested in how software fits into real businesses, from
          telecommunications and manufacturing to wholesale—and in the small
          experiments that help make sense of it all.
        </p>
        <h2>Tools to share</h2>
        <p>
          I’m planning to share a free point-of-sale application here, and
          perhaps a picking application too. Useful tools, along with notes on
          how they work and the processes around them.
        </p>
        <h2>Processes worth sharing</h2>
        <p>
          I often find that useful knowledge about business processes is locked
          behind a wall. I want to share more of it openly: how a process works,
          why it works that way, and what could be better.
        </p>
        <p>
          Sometimes that’s a short post. Sometimes it needs a process map, a
          practical example, or a full set of documentation.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can find new posts in <a href="/writing/">Writing</a> and longer
          guides in <a href="/docs/">Documentation</a>.
        </p>
        <h2>Supergut ehf</h2>
        <p>
          Supergut ehf develops business software, integrations and automation
          solutions, with a focus on Microsoft Dynamics 365 Business Central.
        </p>
        <p>
          Depill.is is owned and operated by Supergut ehf, my Icelandic company,
          registered under kennitala 430524-2160. Depill.is is the company’s
          public-facing brand and website for sharing projects, technical writing
          and documentation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="company-card">
      <span class="eyebrow">Company details</span>
      <dl>
        <dt>Legal company name</dt>
        <dd>{site.company}</dd>
        <dt>Kennitala</dt>
        <dd>{site.registration}</dd>
        <dt>Name</dt>
        <dd>{site.author}</dd>
        <dt>Website</dt>
        <dd>depill.is</dd>
      </dl>
    </aside>
  </div>
</Base>
